      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Hotel knowledge ingest\nPOST { text, title, source } to /hotel-knowledge-ingest.\nSplits the text into chunks, embeds them with Gemini (gemini-embedding-001), and stores them in the hotel_knowledge_documents table (Supabase pgvector).\nIt adds new chunks; it does not delete old ones. To fully replace a document, delete the old rows by metadata->>'source' first.\nProtect this webhook (Header Auth) before exposing it publicly: anyone who can call it can change what the assistant says.",
